OL,3,GNEWSAMeningitis survivor feels
OL,4,A'unstoppable' on UK run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who is running the length of the
OL,7,FUK within 30 days after nearly dying
OL,8,Ffrom meningitis as a teenager says he
OL,9,Ffeels "unstoppable."
OL,11,FJack Stewart, from Bristol, is
OL,12,Fcurrently running the equivalent of an
OL,13,Fultra marathon - every day from John O'
OL,14,FGroats, in Scotland, to Land's End in
OL,15,FCornwall to raise money for Meningitis
OL,16,FResearch Foundation.
OL,18,FThe 30-year-old was initially
OL,19,Fmisdiagnosed with a virus as a
OL,20,F14-year-old in 2009, and a day later
OL,21,Fhis symptoms worsened and he nearly
OL,22,Fdied from meningitis.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
